{"id": "1808770", "name": "שילוב של גבולות מופלאים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q5_SPECIAL_LIMITS_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 4px;\">שילוב של גבולות מופלאים</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">חשבו את הגבול</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}{{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 8px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>בדיקת ההקלדה</strong><br>[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q5_SPECIAL_LIMITS_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px;\">\n<p>לכל אחד מארבעת הביטויים \\(\\displaystyle f_i\\) מתקיים גבול מהסוג</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f_i\\left(x\\right)}{x}=a_i\\)</div>\n<p>וזאת משום שכל אחד מהם הוא אחד מן הביטויים \\(\\displaystyle \\sin\\left(a_i x\\right)\\), \\(\\displaystyle \\ln\\left(1+a_i x\\right)\\), \\(\\displaystyle e^{a_i x}-1\\) או \\(\\displaystyle \\left(1+x\\right)^{a_i}-1\\). בנוסף</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1-\\cos\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)}{x^2}=\\frac{{{CT:2}}^2}{2}\\)</div>\n<p>לכן המונה שקול ל־</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:3}}^{{CT:4}}{{CT:5}}^{{CT:6}}\\left(\\frac{{{CT:2}}^2}{2}\\right)^{{CT:7}}x^{{{CT:4}}+{{CT:6}}+2{{CT:7}}}\\)</div>\n<p>והמכנה שקול ל־</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:8}}^{{CT:9}}{{CT:10}}^{{CT:11}}x^{{{CT:9}}+{{CT:11}}}\\)</div>\n<p>מהבחירה \\(\\displaystyle p_4=2n+p_1+p_2-p_3\\) חזקות \\(\\displaystyle x\\) מתבטלות, ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}{{CT:0}}=\\frac{1}{2^{{{CT:7}}}}\\frac{{{CT:2}}^{2{{CT:7}}}{{CT:3}}^{{{CT:4}}}{{CT:5}}^{{{CT:6}}}}{{{CT:8}}^{{{CT:9}}}{{CT:10}}^{{{CT:11}}}}={{CT:12}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "limit", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a1", "a2", "a3", "a4", "b", "f", "f1", "f2", "f3", "f4", "funcs", "g", "limit", "n", "p1", "p2", "p3", "p4"], "nvariants": 50}